sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Flutter UI (OCR + Review Screen)
    participant MLKit as ML Kit (on-device)
    participant API as ElysiaJS API
    participant LLM as OpenAI API
    participant DB as Neon DB

    UI->>UI: open camera / gallery picker
    UI->>MLKit: processImage(imageFile)
    Note over MLKit: runs locally on device<br/>no network needed
    MLKit-->>UI: raw OCR text (messy)

    UI->>API: POST /bills/:id/ocr { raw_text }
    API->>LLM: "parse this receipt text into [{name, qty, price}]"
    LLM-->>API: structured JSON items
    API-->>UI: parsed items list

    UI->>UI: show editable item rows<br/>(user can edit name / price / qty or delete wrong items)

    UI->>API: POST /bills/:id/items (bulk array)
    API->>DB: INSERT bill_items (batch)
    DB-->>API: items created
    API-->>UI: success
    UI->>UI: navigate → Invite Screen
